    "updated_at": "2020-02-23T19:23:06Z",
    "body": "This could be all implemented in a single module, with options to enable and disable specific parts of it. Or we could have individual modules for each \"kind\" of information. Sort of what we've been doing already.\r\n\r\nThoughts?\r\n\r\nPersonally, I'm leaning towards individual modules.",
